<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφἀ̆σία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφατος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speechlessness,</i> caused by fear or perplexity, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκπληξιν ἡμῖν ἀφασίαν τε προστιθεῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					549
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μ᾽ ἔχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IA</u>
					837
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				904
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡμᾶς λαμβάνει τί ποτε χρὴ λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					636e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀ. τινὰ ἐμβάλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					21d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀ. ἐμβάλλειν πράγματος</span>
			<i>inability to say anything</i> about it, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.211
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
